    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "A boy walked 500 m to the bus stop, travelled 1.8 km on the bus to the train station, made two consecutive train trips of 3.5 and 2.3 km, and then walked 700 m to the school gate. How far was his journey to school, in kilometres?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$8.8\\text{ km}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}500\\text{ m}&=0.5\\text{ km}\\\\700\\text{ m}&=0.7\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$\nAdd the distances in kilometres, aligning the decimal points:\n$$\\begin{array}{r}0.5\\\\1.8\\\\3.5\\\\2.3\\\\+\\;0.7\\\\\\hline8.8\\\\\\hline\\end{array}$$\nThe journey was $8.8\\text{ km}$.",
